{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a responsive Shopify section that closely matches the provided reference design for a coffee brand news section.
    
    **Section heading**
    - Small uppercase eyebrow text: “NECESITO NEWS”
    - Main heading: “What’s brewing in the neighborhood?”
    
    **Layout and design**
    - Use a warm cream background (#F7F3E9 or a similar shade).
    - Use dark forest green (#1D4238) for headings, icons, and borders.
    - Place the eyebrow text at the top, followed by the main heading.
    - Below the heading, create three equal-width cards in a single horizontal row on desktop, with consistent gaps.
    - Each card should have a white/off-white background, a subtle light beige border, slightly rounded corners (approximately 6px), and comfortable internal padding.
    - Keep the design minimal, elegant, clean, and editorial, matching the reference.
    - Use simple, thin-line icons positioned at the top-left of each card.
    - Card titles should be medium-sized, dark green, and left-aligned.
    - Descriptions should be smaller, muted gray-green, and left-aligned.
    - Place an outlined CTA button below the cards, aligned to the left, with the text “Visit Necesito News” and a right-arrow icon.
    - The CTA should have a transparent or cream background, a thin dark green border, slightly rounded corners, and comfortable padding.
    - Preserve the reference's typography hierarchy, spacing, proportions, and understated coffee-shop aesthetic.
    
    **Card content**
    
    Card 1:
    - Icon: Message bubble or comment outline
    - Title: “Upcoming events”
    - Description: “Neighborhood happenings, coming soon.”
    
    Card 2:
    - Icon: Clock outline
    - Title: “Ordering & closures”
    - Description: “Online-only. Find the latest updates.”
    
    Card 3:
    - Icon: Coffee cup outline
    - Title: “Featured coffees”
    - Description: “A closer look at our signature collection.”
    
    **Clickable functionality — required**
    1. Make each entire card clickable, not just its title or icon.
    2. Add an individual URL setting for each card in the Shopify theme editor:
       - Card 1 URL: Upcoming events page
       - Card 2 URL: Ordering and closures updates page
       - Card 3 URL: Featured coffees or coffee collection page
    3. Make the bottom “Visit Necesito News” button clickable, with its own configurable URL setting.
    4. Use Shopify section schema settings so the merchant can edit the heading, eyebrow text, card icons, card titles, descriptions, links, button text, and button link through the theme customizer.
    5. Use semantic HTML anchors for the clickable cards and CTA, with accessible labels and keyboard navigation. Ensure the entire card acts as one clickable link without nested links.
    6. If a card URL is empty, do not render it as a broken or misleading link.
    
    **Responsive behavior**
    - Desktop: three equal-width cards in one row.
    - Tablet: use a balanced two-column layout, with the third card wrapping to the next row.
    - Mobile: stack all cards vertically with consistent spacing.
    - Keep the CTA left-aligned and ensure it fits on small screens.
    - Maintain readable typography, comfortable spacing, and no horizontal overflow.
    
    **Technical requirements**
    - Generate a complete Shopify OS 2.0 compatible section using Liquid, HTML, CSS, and section schema.
    - Use the theme's existing typography where possible.
    - Keep all styles scoped to this section to avoid affecting other sections.
    - Make card spacing, section padding, heading sizes, colors, border radius, and button styling customizable through Shopify settings.
    - Use lightweight inline SVG icons or theme-compatible line icons.
    - Do not add images, gradients, shadows, animations, extra content, or decorative elements that are not present in the reference.
    - Ensure the section works correctly in the Shopify theme editor and on desktop, tablet, and mobile.
    
    The final result should visually match the supplied reference as closely as possible while making all three cards and the CTA fully clickable and editable in Shopify.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;
    max-width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding }}px 24px;
    background: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
  }
  .ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }} *, .ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }} *::before, .ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }} *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { width: 100%; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow { margin: 0 0 12px; color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }}; font-family: inherit; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .12em; line-height: 1.4; }
  .ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 0 32px; color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }}; font-family: inherit; font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.12; }
  .ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: {{ block.settings.card_gap }}px; }
  .ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { display: block; min-height: 180px; padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px; border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }}; border-radius: {{ block.settings.corner_radius }}px; background: {{ block.settings.card_color }}; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  a.ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:focus-visible, .ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid {{ block.settings.heading_color }}; outline-offset: 4px; }
  .ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon { display: block; width: 26px; height: 26px; margin: 0 0 22px; color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }}; }
  .ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title { margin: 0 0 8px; color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }}; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.3; }
  .ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description { margin: 0; color: {{ block.settings.muted_color }}; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 28px; padding: 12px 17px; border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.heading_color }}; border-radius: {{ block.settings.corner_radius }}px; background: transparent; color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }}; font: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.3; text-decoration: none; }
  .ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; flex: 0 0 auto; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) { .ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cards { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding | times: 0.7 | round }}px 18px; }
    .ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size | times: 0.75 | round }}px; }
    .ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: {{ block.settings.card_gap }}px; }
    .ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { min-height: 0; }
    .ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta { max-width: 100%; }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    {% if block.settings.eyebrow != blank %}<p class="ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>{% endif %}
    {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}<h2 class="ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>{% endif %}
    <div class="ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cards">
      {% for i in (1..3) %}
        {% liquid
          assign title_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_title'
          assign description_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_description'
          assign url_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_url'
          assign icon_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_icon'
          assign card_title = block.settings[title_key]
          assign card_description = block.settings[description_key]
          assign card_url = block.settings[url_key]
          assign card_icon = block.settings[icon_key]
        %}
        {% if card_url != blank %}<a class="ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card" href="{{ card_url }}" aria-label="{{ card_title | escape }}: {{ card_description | escape }}">{% else %}<div class="ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card">{% endif %}
          <span class="ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            {% case card_icon %}
              {% when 'message' %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 11.5a7.5 7.5 0 0 1-7.5 7.5H5l-2 2v-7.5A7.5 7.5 0 1 1 20 11.5Z"/><path d="M7.5 11.5h9"/></svg>
              {% when 'clock' %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3.5 2"/></svg>
              {% when 'coffee' %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 8h12v7a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H9a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V8Z"/><path d="M17 10h1a3 3 0 0 1 0 6h-1M8 4v2M12 4v2M16 4v2"/></svg>
            {% endcase %}
          </span>
          <h3 class="ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">{{ card_title | escape }}</h3>
          <p class="ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description">{{ card_description | escape }}</p>
        {% if card_url != blank %}</a>{% else %}</div>{% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% if block.settings.button_url != blank %}<a class="ai-news-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta" href="{{ block.settings.button_url }}">{{ block.settings.button_text | escape }}<svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M3 10h13M11 5l5 5-5 5"/></svg></a>{% endif %}
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Necesito news",
  "settings": [
    {"type":"text","id":"eyebrow","label":"Eyebrow","default":"NECESITO NEWS"},
    {"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Heading","default":"What’s brewing in the neighborhood?"},
    {"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},
    {"type":"header","content":"Card 1"},
    {"type":"select","id":"card_1_icon","label":"Icon","options":[{"value":"message","label":"Message bubble"},{"value":"clock","label":"Clock"},{"value":"coffee","label":"Coffee cup"}],"default":"message"},
    {"type":"text","id":"card_1_title","label":"Title","default":"Upcoming events"},
    {"type":"text","id":"card_1_description","label":"Description","default":"Neighborhood happenings, coming soon."},
    {"type":"url","id":"card_1_url","label":"Card link"},
    {"type":"header","content":"Card 2"},
    {"type":"select","id":"card_2_icon","label":"Icon","options":[{"value":"message","label":"Message bubble"},{"value":"clock","label":"Clock"},{"value":"coffee","label":"Coffee cup"}],"default":"clock"},
    {"type":"text","id":"card_2_title","label":"Title","default":"Ordering & closures"},
    {"type":"text","id":"card_2_description","label":"Description","default":"Online-only. Find the latest updates."},
    {"type":"url","id":"card_2_url","label":"Card link"},
    {"type":"header","content":"Card 3"},
    {"type":"select","id":"card_3_icon","label":"Icon","options":[{"value":"message","label":"Message bubble"},{"value":"clock","label":"Clock"},{"value":"coffee","label":"Coffee cup"}],"default":"coffee"},
    {"type":"text","id":"card_3_title","label":"Title","default":"Featured coffees"},
    {"type":"text","id":"card_3_description","label":"Description","default":"A closer look at our signature collection."},
    {"type":"url","id":"card_3_url","label":"Card link"},
    {"type":"header","content":"Call to action"},
    {"type":"text","id":"button_text","label":"Button text","default":"Visit Necesito News"},
    {"type":"url","id":"button_url","label":"Button link"},
    {"type":"header","content":"Layout"},
    {"type":"range","id":"section_padding","label":"Section padding","min":20,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":60},
    {"type":"range","id":"card_padding","label":"Card padding","min":15,"max":50,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":30},
    {"type":"range","id":"card_gap","label":"Card gap","min":10,"max":50,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":20},
    {"type":"range","id":"heading_size","label":"Heading size","min":24,"max":60,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":42},
    {"type":"range","id":"corner_radius","label":"Corner radius","min":0,"max":16,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":6},
    {"type":"header","content":"Colors"},
    {"type":"color","id":"background_color","label":"Background","default":"#F7F3E9"},
    {"type":"color","id":"card_color","label":"Card background","default":"#FFFCF6"},
    {"type":"color","id":"heading_color","label":"Headings and icons","default":"#1D4238"},
    {"type":"color","id":"text_color","label":"Text","default":"#1D4238"},
    {"type":"color","id":"muted_color","label":"Description","default":"#59675F"},
    {"type":"color","id":"border_color","label":"Border","default":"#E4DDCF"}
  ],
  "presets": [{"name":"Necesito news"}],
  "tag": null,
  "class": "necesito-news-block"
}
{% endschema %}